      <PointerOffset>40860</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_113_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふふふ、オレら、すっげー強くなったよな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heh heh... We're crazy strong now!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>40948</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_113_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そう、かな……あんまり実感ないけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm, maybe...? Somehow, it
doesn't really feel that way...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41088</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_113_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いいや、マジで強いって。『&lt;Dio&gt;と
&lt;Mel&gt;は　もう　じゅうぶんに　つよい』ってヤツだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nah, we're really strong! Like,
everyone watching us is thinking,
"Hey, &lt;Dio&gt; and &lt;Mel&gt;, aren't you
guys strong enough by now!?"</EnglishText>
      <Notes>too long but i'm not really sure how to compress it</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41160</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_113_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>？　なに、それ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh? That's a weird way of putting it...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41256</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_113_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも慢心は禁物だよ！　少しの油断が命取りって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But don't get too cocky!
"Pride comes before a fall," you know.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41316</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_113_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's a good point.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
